# .easignore — files excluded from the EAS Build upload tarball.
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for the upload, so the
# standard ignores below must be kept in sync with .gitignore (or node_modules
# etc. would be uploaded). Extra section = large dirs the native build never uses
# (the 2026-08-21 upload was 819 MB, almost entirely these).

# ── mirror of .gitignore (keep in sync) ──────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.metro-health-check*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
*.pem
.env
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/ios
/android
docs/service_key.txt
supabase/.temp/
_bughunt_tmp/
# Installed agent skills (owner 2026-09-04). `.agents/skills/*` are SYMLINKS on
# disk — copying one into the upload staging dir fails on Windows (EPERM,
# 2026-09-05 build attempt), so they must be excluded here too.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

# ── not needed for the native build (the upload bloat) ───────────────────────
# ⛔ .git IS THE UPLOAD. Measured 2026-09-19: the repo's .git is 663 MB against
# 124 MB of assets, and the build archive was 573 MB taking 6m39s just to
# upload. Nothing in the native build reads the history — `eas build` collects
# the commit metadata BEFORE it makes the tarball, so excluding the directory
# costs nothing and is the single biggest win available here.
.git/
audio_app_archive/
machineA_ingest/
FLAGGED_TERMS/
HANDOFF_2026_08_01_SUB90/
web/
docs/
scripts/
supabase/
*.zip
qr-tubes.png
